<title>USA: National City completes Bridgeport deal.</title>
<headline>National City completes Bridgeport deal.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>National City Bancshares Inc said  Friday it completed the acquisition of Bridgeport Bancorp Inc for  an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Bridgeport Bancorp's First National Bank of Bridgeport has one office  and had total assets of $41 million as of June 30, National City said.  The acquisition was completed as of July 31.</p>
</text>
